**Key insight:** The natural 1ct G-VS2 at $3,230 costs more than the lab 1.5ct D-VVS1 at $1,950. You get 50% more carat weight, two color grades better, and VVS1 clarity instead of VS2. On [men's round diamond rings](/mens-round-diamond-ring), this carat-for-dollar advantage is unmatched.

The 1.5ct range is the value zone for lab. The jump from 1ct to 1.5ct lab adds roughly $1,350 to the stone budget.

The jump from 1.5ct lab to 1.5ct natural adds $8,000–$10,000. Lab pricing creates a grade ladder that natural pricing makes inaccessible.

