For [men's diamond rings](/category/mens-diamond-rings), the setting determines how the stone reads on a wider band. The same 1.5ct stone looks very different in a tapered grooved solitaire vs. a structured architectural setting. The same logic applies to [men's princess cut rings](/mens-princess-cut-ring), where corner-protection changes how the stone reads.

